category: Libs
build-depends: cygport 
sdesc: "Roots acquisition library for Garbage Collector (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "This library abstracts architecture-dependent part of garbage collector roots
acquisition such as register windows of SPARC and register stack backing store
of IA-64. Main part of the code is based on Boehm GC 7.0."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/uim/libgcroots
license: Boehm-GC
